B.baq=new A.w("street","Challenge 15: Sold from a window with no door; hunger knows my bell. What am I?","A food truck")
B.bez=new A.w("church","I rise toward heaven yet stand on earth; bells call the faithful to me. What am I?","A steeple")
B.b6E=new A.w("church","Passed hand to hand yet never owned; peace lives in my circle. What am I?","The sign of peace")
B.bcY=new A.w("church","Deep riddle #18 \u2014 I am bread and wine yet become something greater in belief. What am I?","Communion")
B.bdF=new A.w("church","Whispered on knees, answered in seasons; I move mountains slowly. What am I?","Prayer")
B.bjJ=new A.w("church","Challenge 20: I have no voice but every hymn passes through me. What am I?","A choir loft")
